From 346789561170382dd796bf967acbad0363fec73c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Dr. Hutson" <hutsona@umsystem.edu>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:21:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(cliprdr): validate CB_TEMP_DIRECTORY and make it optional

Decoding now requires dataLen == 520 and a null-terminated wszTempDir
([MS-RDPECLIP] 2.2.2.3). The client skips the optional Temporary Directory
PDU when the backend returns an empty directory. FreeRDP 3.x servers log
"header told length is 520, but actually read 0" for every such PDU
because their handler does not advance the stream; clients without file
transfer support can now avoid the warning.
